DetailNet was trained against texture targets produced by FlashVSR v1.1
(https://huggingface.co/JunhaoZhuang/FlashVSR-v1.1), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. bench/flashvsr_mps.py is a port of FlashVSR's
inference to Apple's MPS backend.

The upscaler uses Apple's VideoToolbox (VTSuperResolutionScaler) and MetalFX
frameworks at runtime on the user's Mac; nothing from Apple is redistributed.

The training and benchmark footage (ABC nature documentaries) is copyrighted
and is not included in this repository.
